Portions of AgentsMonitorKit (keychain service-name derivation, credential read/write
primitives, and OAuth refresh-grant logic in `KeychainService.swift` and
`CredentialStore.swift`) are adapted from Claude-Usage-Tracker
(https://github.com/hamed-elfayome/Claude-Usage-Tracker), MIT-licensed; API-endpoint
behavior (headers, polling cadence, tolerant decoding) follows patterns documented by
CCSeva (https://github.com/Iamshankhadeep/ccseva), also MIT-licensed:

